    "question": {
      ":question/id": "92338a5d-da2f-5d96-86c5-aad374f968a3",
      ":question/problem": "Without using a calculator, find the exact value of\n\n$$\n\\left(\\sin\\left(75^{\\circ}\\right)-\\cos\\left(75^{\\circ}\\right)\\right)^2\n$$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Expand the square and use the Pythagorean identity.\n\nSet $x=75^{\\circ}$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(\\sin x-\\cos x)^2 &= \\sin^2 x-2\\sin x\\cos x+\\cos^2 x \\\\ &=1-2\\sin x\\cos x \\\\ &=1-\\sin(2x)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\sin x\\cos x &=\\sin(2x) \\\\ &=\\sin\\left(150^{\\circ}\\right) \\\\ &=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstitute this exact value:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\left(\\sin\\left(75^{\\circ}\\right)-\\cos\\left(75^{\\circ}\\right)\\right)^2&=1-\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right) \\\\ &=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
